{"ID":"20240506100125-l8jupw3","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506100125-l8jupw3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100125-l8jupw3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100125-81p2ae3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100125-81p2ae3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100125-81p2ae3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"254水苏","type":"doc","updated":"20240822092043"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240627151015-watp08o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627151015-watp08o","updated":"20240822090609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 441px;","style":"width: 431px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水苏"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水苏-20240627151015-4nong4s.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 431px;\" parent-style=\"width: 441px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822090832-3ajei0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822090832-3ajei0w","updated":"20240822091619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 372px;","style":"width: 362px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水苏 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水苏 3-20240822091117-yb4tyut.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 362px;\" parent-style=\"width: 372px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 727px;","style":"width: 717px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水苏 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水苏 2-20240822091022-zcwmnr3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 717px;\" parent-style=\"width: 727px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822091545-sku6gs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822091545-sku6gs8","updated":"20240822091622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 348px;","style":"width: 338px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水苏"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水苏-20240822090832-8f9rg69.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 338px;\" parent-style=\"width: 348px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 494px;","style":"width: 484px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水苏 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水苏 1-20240822090921-4qjpsgj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 484px;\" parent-style=\"width: 494px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 348px;","style":"width: 338px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水苏2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水苏2-20240627151407-fh5nozb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 338px;\" parent-style=\"width: 348px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822091734-48zfzpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822091734-48zfzpe","updated":"20240822091937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 368px;","style":"width: 358px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水苏 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水苏 6-20240822091734-f1hnu2h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 358px;\" parent-style=\"width: 368px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 427px;","style":"width: 417px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水苏 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水苏 8-20240822091933-6vmkwvw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 417px;\" parent-style=\"width: 427px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 422px;","style":"width: 412px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水苏6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水苏6-20240627151910-uydab5u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 412px;\" parent-style=\"width: 422px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822092039-40dtr7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822092039-40dtr7u","updated":"20240822092043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 444px;","style":"width: 434px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水苏 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水苏 9-20240822092039-nnl5szn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 434px;\" parent-style=\"width: 444px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 474px;","style":"width: 464px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"水苏 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/水苏 4-20240822091415-joe14z9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 464px;\" parent-style=\"width: 474px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612153350-zx7aqw1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153350-zx7aqw1"}},{"ID":"20240612153444-onj8zvt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153444-onj8zvt","updated":"20240612153450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水苏《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153444-v1sw2qd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153444-v1sw2qd","updated":"20240612153444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153444-k5x4r2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153444-k5x4r2g","updated":"20240612153444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主下气，辟口臭，去毒，辟恶。久服，通神明，轻身，耐老。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153444-oe3m5i5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153444-oe3m5i5","updated":"20240612153444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：荞蒩一名水苏，一名劳祖（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153444-4gdgfng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153444-4gdgfng","updated":"20240612153444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名鸡苏，一名劳祖，一名芥蒩，一名芥苴，生九真，七月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153444-37ybvhx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153444-37ybvhx","updated":"20240612153444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：苏，桂荏也。《广雅》云：芥蒩，水苏也。《尔雅》云：苏、桂、荏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153444-tfhqegv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153444-tfhqegv","updated":"20240612153444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"郭璞云：苏荏类，故名桂荏。方言云：苏、亦荏也，关之东西或谓之苏或谓之荏，周郑之间，谓之公贲，沅湘之南，谓之（上艹下害），其小者谓之（艹酿）葇，按（艹酿）葇，即香薷也，亦名香葇，《名医》别出香薷条，非，今紫苏薄荷等，皆苏类也，《名医》俱别出之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153444-cpgku8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153444-cpgku8h","updated":"20240612153444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上菜，中品三种，旧四种，考葱实宜与同条，今并假苏，宜入草部。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153350-vrooh2l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153350-vrooh2l"}},{"ID":"20240612153352-acs0tyg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153352-acs0tyg","updated":"20240612153357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水苏《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153352-4vkf9c1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153352-4vkf9c1","updated":"20240612153352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名鸡苏，处处有之。多生水旁，苗似旋复，两叶相当。气香馥，味辛微温，无毒。主肺痿、吐血、衄血、血痢、崩中、带下、产后中风及血不止，头风目眩，诸气疾脚肿。下气消谷，除饮食，辟口臭，去恶毒瓦斯，久服通神耐老。可作菜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153530-if9e37x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153530-if9e37x"}},{"ID":"20240612153531-d62hg5t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153531-d62hg5t","updated":"20240612153536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水苏《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153531-a9lgveq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153531-a9lgveq","updated":"20240612153531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛微温。主下气。辟口臭。去毒辟恶。久服通神明。轻身耐老。生池泽。似荏如苏。水滨漱啮。虚植方茎。丛生对节。齿错参差。脑含辛烈。调饪烹鸡。苴名别。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153531-np65li9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153531-np65li9","updated":"20240612153531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李时珍曰。苏乃荏类。此草似苏。好生水旁。三月生苗。方茎中虚。色青。叶对节生。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153531-b4ij5x9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153531-b4ij5x9","updated":"20240612153531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寇宗曰。叶槎牙如雁齿。吴瑞曰。俗呼龙脑薄荷。梅尧臣诗。膻腥失调饪。李时珍曰。其叶辛香。可以煮鸡。故名鸡苏。名医曰。一名芥。一名芥苴。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153552-1fzgnzf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153552-1fzgnzf"}},{"ID":"20240612153554-f8eznrk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153554-f8eznrk","updated":"20240612153559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡苏《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153554-28qk2od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153554-28qk2od","updated":"20240612153554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（山草）温利下焦血分瘀滞"}]},{"ID":"20240612153554-na80bkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153554-na80bkd","updated":"20240612153554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡苏（专入肠胃）。即龙脑薄荷也。又名水苏。（生于水旁。）系野生之物。味辛微温。功有类于苏薄。但苏薄其性稍凉。水苏其性稍温。苏薄其性主升。水苏其性主降。苏薄多于气分疏散。水苏多于血分温利。故凡肺气上逆。而见头风目眩。与血瘀血热。而见肺痿血痢。吐衄崩淋。喉腥口臭邪热等病者。皆当用此宣泄。（太平和剂局方有龙脑薄荷丸。）俾热除血止。而病自可以愈矣。但表疏汗出。其切忌焉。方茎中虚。似苏叶而微长。齿面皱。气甚辛烈。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153541-7o0ivxq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153541-7o0ivxq"}},{"ID":"20240612153542-ye63mbs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153542-ye63mbs","updated":"20240612153547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水苏《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153542-xra65eu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153542-xra65eu","updated":"20240612153542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名鸡苏"}]},{"ID":"20240612153542-4gotb1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153542-4gotb1z","updated":"20240612153542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛温，无毒。子名荏子。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153542-k0apg0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153542-k0apg0j","updated":"20240612153542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》下气杀谷，除饮食，辟口臭，去邪毒，辟恶气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153542-6cuik4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153542-6cuik4l","updated":"20240612153542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水苏即苏之野生，色青者其气芳香，故《本经》所主一皆胃病，专取芳香正气之义。《局方》用治血病者，取以解散血中之气也。气散则血亦散矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153508-8wr5626","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153508-8wr5626"}},{"ID":"20240612153509-knbf4vr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153509-knbf4vr","updated":"20240612153513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水苏《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153509-jmmzdza","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153509-jmmzdza","updated":"20240612153509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，微温。主下气杀谷，除饮食，辟口臭，去毒，辟恶气。久服通神明，轻身耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153509-h1hql80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153509-h1hql80","updated":"20240612153509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主吐血、衄血、血崩。一名鸡苏，一名劳祖，一名芥 ，一名芥苴。生九真池泽，七月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153509-4g64cll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153509-4g64cll","updated":"20240612153509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"假苏∶味辛，温，无毒。主寒热鼠 ，瘰 生疮，破结聚气，下瘀血，除湿痹。一名鼠 ，一名姜芥。生汉中川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153518-m20afy0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153518-m20afy0"}},{"ID":"20240612153519-ya6wgct","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153519-ya6wgct","updated":"20240612153523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水苏《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153519-9ow7tgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153519-9ow7tgl","updated":"20240612153519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经中品）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153519-ol08vd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153519-ol08vd8","updated":"20240612153519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】辛，微温，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153519-1lq4mnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153519-1lq4mnr","updated":"20240612153519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主下气，杀谷，除饮食，辟口臭，去邪毒，辟恶气。久服通神明，轻身耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153457-r7jdei8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153457-r7jdei8"}},{"ID":"20240612153458-mj849e2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153458-mj849e2","updated":"20240612153503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水苏《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153458-09zdz5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153458-09zdz5i","updated":"20240612153458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，微温，无毒。主下气，杀谷，除饮食，辟口臭，去毒，辟恶气。久服通神明，轻身耐老。主吐血、衄血、血崩。一名鸡苏，一名劳祖，一名芥 （音祖），一名芥苴（七余陶隐居云∶方∶药不用，俗中莫识。九真辽远，亦无能访之。唐本注云∶此苏生下湿水侧，苗似旋复，两叶相当，大香馥。青、齐、河间人名为水苏，江左名为荠 ，吴会谓之鸡苏。主申吐血紫白挪碎绵裹塞耳，疗聋。又，头风目眩者，以清酒煮汁一升服。产后中风，服之弥佳。可烧作灰汁及以煮汁，洗头令发香，白屑不生。又，收讫酿酒及渍酒，常服之佳。日华子云∶鸡苏，暖。治肺痿，崩中，带下，血痢，头风目眩，产后中风及血不止。又名臭苏、青白苏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153458-14vxc5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153458-14vxc5l","updated":"20240612153458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶水苏，生九真池泽，今处处有之。多生水岸旁，苗似旋覆，两叶相当，大香馥，青、济间呼为水苏，江左名为荠 ，吴会谓之鸡苏。南人多以作菜。主诸气疾及脚肿。江北甚多谓鸡苏、水苏是两种。陈藏器谓荠 自是一物，非水苏。水苏叶有雁齿，香薷气辛，荠 叶上有毛，稍长，气臭。主冷气泄痢，可为生菜。除胃间酸水，亦可捣敷蚁 。亦有石上生者，名石荠 ，紫花细叶，高一、二尺，味辛，温，无毒。主风血冷气煮汁服，山中人多用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153458-cpgp0a5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153458-cpgp0a5","updated":"20240612153458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"梅师方∶治吐血及下血并妇人漏下。鸡苏茎、叶煎取汁，饮之。又方∶治鼻衄血不止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153458-k4wlnxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153458-k4wlnxi","updated":"20240612153458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生鸡苏五合，香豉二合，合杵研，槎如枣核大，纳鼻中，止。又方∶卒漏血欲死，煮一升服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153458-h10t76u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153458-h10t76u","updated":"20240612153458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶水苏，气味与紫苏不同，辛而不和，然一如苏，但面不紫，及周遭槎牙如雁齿，香少。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153353-njqc1xn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153353-njqc1xn"}},{"ID":"20240612153410-wvhwmr5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153410-wvhwmr5","updated":"20240612153415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水苏《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153410-pqh5b0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153410-pqh5b0u","updated":"20240612153410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即鸡苏。俗呼为龙脑薄荷。以生东平龙脑冈者为良。三月生苗。方茎中虚。叶似苏叶而微长。面皱色青。密齿紫背。气甚辛烈。六七月开水红花。成穗结子如荆芥。沃地者。苗高四五尺。其子不如紫苏。因紫苏以八月开花结子。而水苏子早。非禀金气之浓也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153410-29j06hh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153410-29j06hh","updated":"20240612153410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茎叶味辛。气微温。主治下气。辟恶气。疗吐血衄血。肺痿崩中。带下血痢。酒煮汁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153410-s95ty5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153410-s95ty5p","updated":"20240612153410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治头风目眩。及产后中风。恶血不止。作生菜食。除胃间酸水。其功专于理血下气。（大都逆上之血用之的有殊效）清肺辟恶消谷。故局方治吐衄咳唾。下血血淋。口臭苦甜喉腥诸病。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153410-3znr4l1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153410-3znr4l1","updated":"20240612153410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有龙脑薄荷丸。衄血不止。鸡苏叶生地等分。为末。冷水服。脑热鼻渊。肺壅多涕。鸡苏叶麦冬川芎桑白皮炒黄炙草生地等分。为末。炼蜜丸梧子大。每服四十丸。人参汤下。风热头痛。（热结上焦。致生风气。）痰厥头痛。水苏叶五两。皂荚炙去皮子三两。芫花醋炒焦一两。为末。炼蜜丸梧子大。每服二十丸。食后荆芥汤下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153410-novxj8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153410-novxj8h","updated":"20240612153410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕紫苏水苏。味皆辛。气皆温。皆为火中之金。第水苏辛味胜于紫苏。而气之温则逊之。且采以七月。取乘金之进气也。夫金以火为主。火以金为用。二者固相合而相须。然五行有递为君之时。因于成功退而将来进也。如紫苏叶面背俱紫。已全禀乎火之气矣。又采于五月。因其时以全其气也。水苏叶面青背紫。已不全禀乎火之气矣。采以七月。则因于火之退气。乘乎金之进气也。全乎火之气者。金为火用。裨火得化水而为血。故心主脉。脉舍血。虽则化血。总以全其大火之气也。若乘乎金之气者。火又藉金以为用。俾火之化水为血者。仍行其清化。使胃生之。脾统之。肝藏之。而火更因此以宿于水焉。（金以火为主。故阴得阳而血化。血化而气益畅。似归功于气者紫苏也。火以金为用。故阳得阴而气清。气清而血得静。似归功于血者水苏也。）夫水火之升降。全藉于木与金。金以火为主。而木又以金为主。如火中之金不得司其凉降。则肝之从阴而达于上者。不得阳中之阴接引。将木火交煽而邪热益炽矣。水苏由火而独专其金气。有不奏功于吐衄咳唾喉腥口臭及苦甜者欤。虽然。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153410-fhuomg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153410-fhuomg9","updated":"20240612153410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血固心主之。胃生之。能使归其所藏而纳之血海者。则肝也。肝之所以能纳血者。由肺之气能归于胃。以至肝也。肺气所以能归于胃者。全由凉降之气。使火就金妻而宅水于中。木依水母而随金以下。升已而降。不致木火之相煽也。（经曰。伤肺者脾气不守。胃气不清。经气不为使。真藏坏决。经脉傍绝。五藏漏泄。不衄则呕。绎此则由火中之金。而金得司其职者。犹不能令血归其藏而致逆漏欤。）此味于血证有殊效者。缘不以苦寒退血中之火。而以火中之金气和之。握生化之机权以为升降。所谓火得归宿于水者。是本经首言下气。理固可参。而又能疗风。可愈知其专于理血以化气矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153410-5zjwu3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153410-5zjwu3r","updated":"20240612153410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采取适时紫苏以五月。水苏则七月。紫苏子九月。半枯时收。如市肆茎叶子多于霜后采取。采时则气味俱失。何可用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153410-4rpl14c","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153410-4rpl14c"}},{"ID":"20240612153421-3xcndpi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-3xcndpi","updated":"20240612153425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水苏《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153421-pit4o80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-pit4o80","updated":"20240612153421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」鸡苏、香苏、龙脑薄荷、芥苴。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153421-bjfodet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-bjfodet","updated":"20240612153421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（茎、叶）辛、微温、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153421-0p71p2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-0p71p2z","updated":"20240612153421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612153421-24cfbrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-24cfbrz","updated":"20240612153421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、漏血，用水苏煮汁一升服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153421-00rngxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-00rngxz","updated":"20240612153421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、吐血、下血。用水苏茎叶，煎汁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153421-f4o0tq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-f4o0tq0","updated":"20240612153421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、吐血咳嗽。用水苏焙干研细，每服一钱，米汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153421-3zl4f3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-3zl4f3u","updated":"20240612153421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、鼻血不止。用水苏五合，香豉二俣，同捣烂，搓成小团，如枣核在、塞鼻孔中，鼻血即止。又方：水苏二两，防风一两，共研为末。每服二钱，温水送下。同时以水苏叶塞鼻。又方：水苏、生地典，等分为末，冷水送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153421-jald777","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-jald777","updated":"20240612153421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、鼻渊（按：鼻渊俗名脑漏，鼻中不断流水、流脓，或脓中带血）。用水苏叶、麦站科、川芎、桑白皮、炙黄芪、炙甘草、生地黄（焙），等分为末，加炼蜜做成丸子，如梧子大。每服四十丸，人参汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153421-ohvuzy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-ohvuzy3","updated":"20240612153421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、风热头痛（热结上焦，致生风气，痰厥头痛）。用水苏叶五两、皂荚（炙，去皮，去子）三两、芫花（醋炒焦）一两，共研为末。加炼蜜做成丸子，如梧子大。每服二十丸，饭后服，荆芥汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153421-5wot8gv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-5wot8gv","updated":"20240612153421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、突然耳聋。用水苏叶生捣，棉裹，塞耳内。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153421-tsqdvx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-tsqdvx8","updated":"20240612153421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、头生白屑。用水苏煮汗或烧灰淋汁洗头。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153421-ldlp5hc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153421-ldlp5hc","updated":"20240612153421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、蛇虫咬伤。用水苏研末，酒冲服。并以敷伤处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153426-79gh8iz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153426-79gh8iz"}},{"ID":"20240612153430-8l3b91v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153430-8l3b91v","updated":"20240612153437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水苏《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153430-u9uo533","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153430-u9uo533","updated":"20240612153430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，微温，无毒。主下气，杀谷，除饮食，辟口臭，去毒，辟恶气。久服通神明，轻身耐老，主吐血、衄血、血崩。一名鸡苏，一名劳祖，一名芥苴，一名瓜苴，一名道华。生九真池泽，七月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153430-oszen90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153430-oszen90","updated":"20240612153430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方药不用，俗中莫识。昔九真辽远，亦无能识访之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153430-ryaglmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153430-ryaglmw","updated":"20240612153430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此苏，生下湿水侧，苗似旋复，两叶相当，大香馥。青、济、开、河间人名为水苏，江左名为荠苎，吴会谓之鸡苏。主吐血、衄血、下气、消谷大效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153430-2vd905t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153430-2vd905t","updated":"20240612153430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而陶更于菜部出鸡苏，误矣。今以鸡苏为水苏之一名，复申吐血、衄血、血崩六字也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153431-ya730u4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153431-ya730u4"}},{"ID":"20240612153432-fncnyfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153432-fncnyfo"}}]}